  unitName: Red Blade Farlon
  unitId: 10334
  unitNumber: 448
  description: Wielding both blade and fire, he chased after the one who betrayed
    the Guardians. It's said that when a report came concerning the traitor, Sodis,
    he was pleased by opportunity he'd been handed. He brushed off his sweetheart
    as she tried to stop him before heading off to vanquish Sodis, only to be defeated
    instead. It's even said that Sodis had to hold back so that he didn't accidentally
    kill him. His pride damaged and his anger out of control, Farlon then dedicated
    himself to defeating Sodis.
  summonDesc: A Summoner, I see.<br>I'll use anything at my disposal<br>to destroy
    him!
  fusionDesc: I need more magic power!<br>Make me stronger!<br>I must redeem myself!
  evoDesc: My flames grow stronger!<br>Still, I've yet a ways to go<br>before becoming
    the strongest! <br>
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
